{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"spain-unemployment-benefit UI copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","detected_language":"es","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"spain-unemployment-benefit.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer","keys":["spain-unemployment-benefit.copy.additionalFaqs.1.answer"],"locale":"es","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Este cálculo solo estima una cantidad mensual. No determina la elegibilidad, el historial de cotizaciones, la duración de la prestación o el derecho a reclamar. Asume un empleo a tiempo completo y utiliza los mínimos y máximos del SEPE ZXQPH0000QXZ. El trabajo a tiempo parcial utiliza un tope proporcional del IPREM que no se calcula aquí.","record_id":"518c4b904abcff753d11d14e204cf793cdad8379e571e4590c249de908106695","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40523422271","seconds":2.9749722547499005,"source":"This estimates only a monthly amount. It does not determine eligibility, contribution history, benefit duration or a right to claim. It assumes full-time employment and uses the 2026 SEPE minimums and maximums. Part-time work uses a proportional IPREM cap that is not calculated here. Confirm the inputs and current rules with SEPE.","source_commit":"65626e5376c5d623fb48ed0c157c91316f836307","source_hash":"9820f099d59c11289e2af885eb3bef82604899437e135d46844a851a4e1e8192","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Este cálculo solo estima una cantidad mensual. No determina la elegibilidad, el historial de cotizaciones, la duración de la prestación o el derecho a reclamar. Asume un empleo a tiempo completo y utiliza los mínimos y máximos del SEPE 2026. El trabajo a tiempo parcial utiliza un tope proporcional del IPREM que no se calcula aquí.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
